.SH NAME
tagents-log - Read agent session log


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtagents log  [lines] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the agent's session transcript log.

.PP
For Claude Code agents: finds the most recent JSONL log file under ~/.claude/projects/
and renders it as human-readable conversation (or raw JSONL with --raw).

.PP
Default: last 100 lines.

.PP
Examples:
  tagents log my-agent
  tagents log my-agent 200
  tagents log my-agent --raw


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for log

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	Output raw JSONL without parsing


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--all-machines\fP[=false]
	Target all hosts from SSH config

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Verbose logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--fields\fP=""
